<title>USA: Micro Linear sets stock repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Micro Linear sets stock repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micro Linear Corp Monday on Monday said it planned to repurchase up to $2.2 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>As of April 21, the company, an integrated circuit maker, had about 11.3 million shares outstanding.</p>
